  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Accountable Grant OHM0926: MAINSTREAMING LIVELIHOOD-CENTRED APPROACHES TO DISASTER MANAGEMENT (CHF) is a component of Disaster Risk Reduction Projects in Conflict Humanitarian Fund 2005 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;758,366. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Employment creation, Education policy and administrative management, Social Protection, Democratic participation and civil society.</narrative>
  </description>
